    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "OpenAI-compatible REST API for the Featherless AI serverless inference platform. A single Bearer-authenticated interface serves thousands of open-weight Hugging Face models for chat completions, legacy text completions, embeddings, and model discovery. Pricing is a flat monthly subscription with unlimited tokens rather than per-token billing.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Featherless AI Support",
